KEBallProbe/ComplexDeterminant.lean adapts the real-matrix Jacobi formula
proof from PoincareLib/Analysis/Matrix/Determinant.lean to complex matrices
with differentiation over the real scalars. See Poincare-Conjecture.LICENSE,
Poincare-Conjecture.NOTICE, and the source revisions in docs/THIRD_PARTY.md.
